      <activity id="cb9561e1-374b-5cc5-8734-4657a553870e" activityNameId="56fce25e-8a66-5771-9e57-9e0eaf09460a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Crude oil, import mix, at long distance transport</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Crude oil, import mix, at long distance transport
Crude oil imports from different countries based on IEA Oil Statistics 2021. Some production countries are modelled with datasets for countries in the same region. Crude oil production in the Former Soviet Union is allocated to Russia, Kazakhstan and Azerbaijan based on EIA production estimates for 2019/2021.; UUID:57f3a557-cc9c-305c-964a-77fd22b38910
Crude oil mix processed by European refineries in 2021.
Location: Crude oil supplied to Europe.
Technology: Mix of crude oil from various oil producing countries and world regions
Time period: 
Production volume: 535.3 million tons supplied to Europe in 2021
Sampling: Statistics
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_57f3a557-cc9c-305c-964a-77fd22b38910.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
